We want to prove: $\operatorname{ht}(\mathfrak m) \le n + 1$. Suppose $\operatorname{ht}(\mathfrak m) \ge n + 2$, so there's a chain

$$\mathfrak p_0 \subsetneq \mathfrak p_1 \subsetneq \dots \subsetneq \mathfrak p_{n+1} = \mathfrak m$$

